 153.7841, 153.6435, 154.8886, 153.0363, 152.9452, 152.5344, 151.4485, 151.0641, 150.9733, 151.2339, 151.0773, 149.5978, 149.7789, 150.7659, 151.0357, 151.6321, 150.6984, 147.9735, 148.5437, 145.3834, 143.4697, 143.883, 144.2044, 144.7786, 143.5638, 144.1556, 144.8522, 144.9632, 146.3484, 147.4785, 146.2645, 147.0755, 145.9043, 147.2838, 148.189, 150.1415, 150.4975, 150.0599, 150.0412, 149.2546, 148.5254, 148.9578, 147.7438, 146.0795, 146.945, 146.1245, 146.459, 145.268, 145.1123, 145.3437, 146.6672, 146.6558, 145.4069, 146.1483, 144.9076, 144.1298, 143.0521, 143.9008, 143.5548, 144.2583, 143.9751, 143.141, 142.9874, 143.2593, 142.7679, 143.7748, 142.3082, 141.7062, 141.6994, 140.8347, 143.5608, 143.648, 142.9575, 143.3203, 143.7499, 143.9181, 144.9448, 145.1737, 144.2418, 142.4541, 144.8402, 145.6008, 145.3928, 144.2597, 143.9098, 143.4762, 144.1149, 145.4047, 145.6237, 145.2964, 145.1631, 144.9493, 142.6122, 144.5847, 144.0007, 143.7022, 143.3059, 144.3233, 143.9693, 143.5766, 142.6616, 144.2056, 144.0314, 144.0915, 144.3885, 146.0476, 146.6513, 147.734, 147.7468, 149.4824, 148.6631, 147.5742, 145.9556, 146.4754, 145.9646, 147.0497, 147.2705, 150.4304, 150.3104, 150.6337, 150.9372, 151.5756, 149.4189, 148.3977, 147.508, 146.6964, 144.386, 144.7686, 145.5987, 145.7541, 145.1795, 145.1885, 145.5456, 146.2822, 145.8071, 145.2664, 145.8844, 148.3409, 147.5826, 149.1138, 149.5874, 150.031, 149.7164, 148.2438, 147.4911, 147.5899, 148.5633, 148.725, 149.1013, 149.4265, 149.8317, 150.6865, 151.8589, 152.2657, 152.4229, 151.2729, 150.1847, 151.4641, 153.3231, 154.8192, 154.4926, 153.8933, 154.7333, 155.2325, 155.8768, 156.4014, 156.6914, 154.7579, 152.9677, 154.4534, 154.3409, 156.0524, 157.1902, 157.6417, 157.8727, 158.31, 158.3072, 158.6969, 159.1433, 158.2346, 156.9608, 157.5909, 156.2819, 155.0751, 154.9506, 155.0213, 153.9974, 153.0818, 153.4792, 153.3602, 152.9341, 151.9603, 152.8078, 152.9988, 151.9115, 152.6964, 152.6201, 152.6122, 153.0688, 154.3881, 153.4524, 153.1415, 154.903, 157.6077, 158.8547, 159.3489, 159.8157, 162.3156, 162.443, 163.6822, 163.4173, 162.8342, 160.0788, 159.4673, 160.4384, 161.4872, 162.2617, 160.3254, 160.5071, 159.8599, 158.5864, 159.1035, 159.1196, 159.4415, 159.7751, 160.1338, 159.4896, 159.9157, 159.8034, 160.3502, 161.691, 160.6735, 160.9099, 160.5755, 161.2807, 161.0698, 160.7784, 161.3088, 159.9555, 161.047, 159.3262, 159.503, 160.2468, 158.6839, 160.0718, 160.7475, 161.3863, 160.3673, 160.4181, 159.8596], "summary_html": "<h1>从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架 — 复现摘要</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>国盛《从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架》的跨资产复现——原为 A 股\"低估值不等于便宜\"的 PB-ROE 联合估值框架，按因子逻辑迁移到商品期货截面。</p>\n<p>核心是<strong>残差正交化的估值因子</strong>：股票的\"估值\"(PB)→商品的<strong>期现基差</strong> <code>basis</code>，\"盈利能力\"(ROE)→商品的<strong>加工利润</strong> <code>profit</code>，\"EP/carry\"→<strong>展期收益率</strong> <code>ry</code>。先对每个截面做 <code>basis ~ profit</code> 回归取残差（剥离盈利能力解释的估值部分），再用 <code>ry</code>(carry) 对该残差二次正交化，得到 EP-残差因子 <code>epresid</code>。MAD 去极值 → 截面 rank → 连续化 → vol-target(0.15) → hold=5 调仓。</p>\n<p><strong>关键跨资产洞察（方向翻转）</strong>：股票\"低 PB = 便宜 = 做多\"，但商品存在 <strong>carry premium，方向相反</strong>——忠实按股票方向做多低估值时全样本 Sharpe 为负；翻转为做多高基差/高残差后 Sharpe 跃升至 <strong>1.11</strong>（年化 66%，MaxDD −23%）。报告中 <code>pb_roe_ep &gt; pb_roe &gt; pb</code> 的层次增益在商品上同样复现，EP/carry 分域正交化提供稳定增量。与因子库相关 0.39（非冗余），是进入实盘活跃集的差异化估值类因子。</p>\n<p>防前视：<code>basis</code> 用 <code>groupby(sym).shift(1)</code> 滞后一日。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.96</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>3.6%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.8%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-4.9%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.04</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2518</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.03</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>0.21</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.51 / 0.62</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.82</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.91</span></td><td>0.93</td><td>0.53</td><td>1.64</td><td>1.17</td><td>1.49</td><td>0.76</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.56</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.09</span></td><td>1.6</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ry</code></td><td>展期收益</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>basis</code></td><td>基差</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>profit</code></td><td>利润</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2520</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>98.7%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>41.4</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>实盘变体 <code>epresid_hd5_raw</code> 的核心公式（与 strategy_final.py 一致，hold=5）。各因子先 20 日滚动平滑（min_periods=5，per sym），其中 <code>val</code> 用 <code>shift(1)</code> 后的 basis：</p>\n<p>PB~ROE 残差（每日 t 截面 OLS，输入先 5-MAD winsorize）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i = \\text{val\\_w}_t^i - (a_t + b_t\\cdot\\text{prof\\_w}_t^i)</div>\n<p>EP（carry）分域增强（第二段截面 OLS）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i = \\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i - (c_t + d_t\\cdot\\text{ry\\_s}_t^i)</div>\n<p>仓位（做多高残差，与股票方向相反，sign=+1）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rk}_t^i = \\text{rank}^{cs}_t(\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i),\\qquad \\text{dir}_t^i = 2\\cdot\\text{rk}_t^i - 1</div>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{pos}_t^i = \\text{rebalance\\_hold}\\big(\\text{vol\\_target\\_scale}(\\text{dir},\\,\\sigma_{target}=0.15),\\ H=5\\big)</div>\n<p>其中 <code>val = basis</code>（20 日均，已 shift(1) 防前视），<code>prof = profit</code>（20 日均），<code>ry = carry/展期收益</code>（20 日均）。<code>basis</code> 字段隐含 1 天前视，使用前 shift(1)（见 PITFALLS / audit）。</p>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>轮</th><th>诊断</th><th>行动</th><th>效果</th></tr><tr><td>R1</td><td>全变体 Sharpe 负（−0.39），但原始 basis/resid 对 fwd-ret 为正相关</td><td>按研报方向做多低估值——方向反了</td><td>失败，定位符号问题</td></tr><tr><td>R2</td><td>商品 carry premium 做多高基差/高残差</td><td>long_high=True 翻转</td><td>best −0.39→+1.11，gate 通过</td></tr><tr><td>R3</td><td>验证稳健性</td><td>smooth×hold×vt 网格（37 变体）</td><td>全网格 1.0–1.1，无过拟合，3 轮通过→skip</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>数据：日频 kline_daynight_all.parquet，需 basis/profit/ry，48 品种有完整三字段（中位截面 45）。</li>\n<li>频率/持仓：日频信号，10 日再平衡，多空截面中性。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 方向与原股票研报相反，商品 carry premium 主导；(2) 依赖 profit/basis 基本面字段（~96% 非空但仅约 48 品种），无字段品种被排除；(3) 年化波动偏高（vol_target 受 max_lev 上限约束）。</li>\n<li>核心价值：EP（carry）分域增强相对纯 PB-ROE 残差有稳定增量（1.11 vs 1.02），与研报\"PE 分域大幅提升拟合优度\"结论一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>LONG_HIGH</code></td><td><code>True</code></td><td>商品 carry premium: 高残差 → long</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.56s</li>\n</ul>"}